        "original_id": "753068a9-de51-5207-a7c5-9deeb2d88ca4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Anders, Micky Dolenz, Nora Balling\n- Roles: singer, composer, record producer, actor, musician, television director, radio personality, theater director, fashion model\n- Organizations: the Monkees, Modern Talking\n- Places: Germany, Koblenz\n\nFacts:\n- Micky Dolenz was born as George Michael Dolenz, Jr. on March 8, 1945.\n- Micky Dolenz is an American actor, musician, television director, radio personality, and theater director.\n- Micky Dolenz is best known as a vocalist and drummer of the 1960s pop/rock band the Monkees.\n- Thomas Anders was born as Bernd Weidung on March 1, 1963.\n- Thomas Anders is a German singer, composer, and record producer.\n- Nora Balling, also known as Nora Anders, was born on July 31, 1964, in Koblenz, Germany.\n- Nora Balling is a German fashion model.\n- Nora Balling was the first wife of singer Thomas Anders from 1984 to 1999.\n- Thomas Anders was a member of Modern Talking.",
